      "note": "OMBS.S.AI and its sub-dimensions assess whether the learner remained the source of choice while making something. They do not assess understanding of AI as subject matter — how models work, where they fail, their societal effects — which is AI literacy and belongs to the UNESCO framework. A tool that reads S.AI as an AI-literacy measure has misread it. See STANDARD.md §1.3 and §4.6.1."
